  "description": "Project (catalog) services for Zonit applications. Provides ICatalogProvider (the active project and the visible project list as read-only Project value objects), ICatalogManager (per-scope catalog state and project switching) and IProjectSource, the contract your app implements to supply the data. Framework-agnostic: no HttpContext and no middleware here - the ASP.NET Core middleware that hydrates the scope ships in Zonit.Extensions.Website. Built on top of Zonit.Extensions value objects (Project).",
